472
01:33:50,515 --> 01:33:51,115
Şöyle.

473
01:33:59,028 --> 01:34:01,828
İşte y eşittir, y 2 x olsun.

474
01:34:03,628 --> 01:34:06,268
y eşittir, y 2 x olsun.

475
